<title>USA: Cerplex in pact with Digital.</title>
<headline>Cerplex in pact with Digital.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cerplex Group Inc said Tuesday it landed a multi-year contract to provide vendor service parts sourcing to Digital Equipment Corp.</p>
<p>The new contract will add about $16 million in 1997 revenues for Cerplex's service parts division, the company said.</p>
<p>Cerplex expects to begin supplying parts to Digital under the terms of this contract during the fourth quarter of 1996, ramping to full volume early in 1997.</p>
<p>Cerplex provides high technology service outsourcing, including repair and remanufacturing, parts and logistics services.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
